## Input

```css
@use "sass:list";
@use "sass:meta";

$x:[NOT];
.uppercase-not{length:list.length($x);value:meta.inspect($x);}

$x:[foo AND];
.uppercase-and{length:list.length($x);value:meta.inspect($x);}

$x:[true OR false];
.uppercase-or{length:list.length($x);value:meta.inspect($x);}

